   "en": "Yoshitake Asuka has achieved her dream of becoming an elementary school teacher. However, the school full of smiling children turns out to be the worst workplace, where power harassment and sexual harassment are rampant by the principal's favorite teachers behind the scenes. Yoshitake's heart is about to break during these hellish days, but she unexpectedly knows that Koichi Kamimiya, a part-time teacher was also being bullied."
